---
import { LANGUAGE_VERSIONS } from '../data/languageVersions.ts';
const { python, rust } = LANGUAGE_VERSIONS;
---
<p class="inline-block mb-4 rounded-md border border-[var(--sl-color-gray-5)] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-[var(--sl-color-gray-3)]">All code was tested with Python {python} and Rust {rust}. It should work with any recent version of each language.</p>
